WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.070
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

3
01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 46= (This drama does not correspond)

5
01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
01:41.480 --> 01:42.310
- Yes! - Yes!

8
01:43.040 --> 01:43.950
- Yes! - Yes!

9
01:46.920 --> 01:48.510
By day, follow the banners.

10
01:49.200 --> 01:50.760
By night, follow the lanterns.

11
01:51.208 --> 01:53.640
Make sure the units support one another from front to rear

12
01:53.864 --> 01:55.400
and stay connected from side to side,

13
01:55.510 --> 01:56.760
so that nothing goes amiss.

14
01:57.384 --> 01:59.200
Anyone who deliberately lets the enemy escape

15
01:59.448 --> 02:01.150
or causes delays in military operations,

16
02:01.760 --> 02:03.590
thereby jeopardizing the mission,

17
02:04.590 --> 02:05.430
will be

18
02:05.880 --> 02:07.944
beheaded and their head displayed as a warning.

19
02:27.630 --> 02:28.430
Your Lordship.

20
02:31.080 --> 02:32.000
It's nothing serious.

21
02:33.870 --> 02:34.750
Move out.

22
02:35.310 --> 02:37.000
Set out for the capital.

23
02:53.416 --> 02:55.100
(Upholding the Virtue of Generations Past)

24
02:55.120 --> 02:56.150
Old Master,

25
02:56.150 --> 02:58.790
the pirates split into three groups and attacked the Lin Residence.

26
02:58.800 --> 03:01.080
Fortunately, the Lin family was prepared

27
03:01.144 --> 03:02.728
and fought them off on separate fronts.

28
03:02.910 --> 03:04.590
After Madam killed the pirate leader,

29
03:04.710 --> 03:06.584
the City Patrol Office arrived in time as well.

30
03:06.600 --> 03:08.790
Most of the household guards suffered only minor injuries.

31
03:08.800 --> 03:10.130
Only two were seriously wounded.

32
03:10.800 --> 03:12.560
The physician is treating them now.

33
03:13.310 --> 03:14.560
Their lives are not in danger.

34
03:24.000 --> 03:24.800
Xu,

35
03:25.910 --> 03:27.630
how did you know

36
03:27.910 --> 03:31.840
the pirates would attack the Lin Residence last night?

37
03:34.680 --> 03:35.910
I dare not take the credit.

38
03:36.400 --> 03:37.470
His Lordship and I

39
03:37.680 --> 03:39.240
worked it out together.

40
03:39.870 --> 03:41.150
Jinling is the southern capital.

41
03:42.190 --> 03:43.840
Given how cunning Du Cuique is,

42
03:44.080 --> 03:45.680
she wouldn't be naive enough to think

43
03:45.750 --> 03:47.320
that with a band of desperate outlaws,

44
03:47.360 --> 03:48.870
she could run rampant and kill at will.

45
03:52.190 --> 03:53.960
Du Cuique had something else to rely on.

46
03:59.280 --> 04:00.870
Du Cuique has allied herself with Wona.

47
04:02.590 --> 04:03.630
She made a show of one plan

48
04:03.752 --> 04:05.464
while secretly carrying out another.

49
04:05.870 --> 04:07.190
Revenge was only a pretext.

50
04:07.560 --> 04:09.430
She planned to work with Wona from within

51
04:10.056 --> 04:11.190
to destroy the provisions.

52
04:12.312 --> 04:13.680
When the nest is overturned,

53
04:14.190 --> 04:15.150
no egg remains intact.

54
04:18.008 --> 04:19.680
A thief can scheme for a thousand days,

55
04:20.200 --> 04:22.424
but no one can guard against one for a thousand days.

56
04:22.870 --> 04:24.240
Rather than defend passively,

57
04:25.870 --> 04:27.160
we should take the initiative.

58
04:28.070 --> 04:29.390
We might as well give her

59
04:29.390 --> 04:30.800
a taste of her own medicine

60
04:31.270 --> 04:32.270
and make Du Cuique

61
04:32.360 --> 04:34.328
suffer the consequences of her own scheme.

62
04:35.070 --> 04:35.750
Nanke,

63
04:36.950 --> 04:38.750
go to Duke Xiangguo's Residence tonight

64
04:38.808 --> 04:40.430
and deliver a secret letter to His Grace.

65
04:40.950 --> 04:42.510
Now that we know the pirates' objective,

66
04:43.120 --> 04:44.360
we can determine

67
04:44.510 --> 04:46.560
the best time for them to burn the provisions.

68
04:46.760 --> 04:48.456
That will be the perfect opportunity

69
04:48.504 --> 04:49.950
to lure them all out of hiding

70
04:50.168 --> 04:51.784
and wipe them out in one strike,

71
04:51.880 --> 04:53.512
putting an end to the threat for good.

72
04:55.240 --> 04:55.920
Good.

73
04:59.560 --> 05:01.920
If you hadn't been at the Lin Residence,

74
05:02.270 --> 05:05.920
Jinqi couldn't have left with peace of mind to escort the provisions.

75
05:07.000 --> 05:08.720
You played a vital role

76
05:10.270 --> 05:12.190
in wiping out the pirates last night.

77
05:32.390 --> 05:33.270
Old Master.

78
05:34.190 --> 05:34.830
Lanxiang.

79
05:35.360 --> 05:36.160
Jinqiao.

80
05:37.510 --> 05:38.800
Fengxian fell

81
05:39.000 --> 05:40.510
and knocked out four front teeth.

82
05:41.120 --> 05:42.510
I heard Nanny Du say

83
05:42.520 --> 05:44.940
there's an old physician who's very skilled at treating teeth.

84
05:44.950 --> 05:46.600
I'll take Fengxian to see him right away.

85
05:59.870 --> 06:00.430
Jinqiao.

86
06:01.950 --> 06:03.680
I was wounded by the pirates.

87
06:03.800 --> 06:06.248
But the pirates never even reached the inner residence.

88
06:06.680 --> 06:08.950
Didn't Lanxiang tell you to stay in Zhichun Hall?

89
06:09.800 --> 06:11.600
Fengxian thought the room was too crowded

90
06:11.640 --> 06:13.992
and tried to sneak back to her own courtyard to sleep.

91
06:14.190 --> 06:16.070
Then a sudden loud noise

92
06:16.168 --> 06:18.632
startled her so badly that her legs gave way and she fell.

93
06:18.720 --> 06:20.560
She wasn't hurt anywhere else.

94
06:20.680 --> 06:22.600
But of all places, her mouth struck a stone,

95
06:23.120 --> 06:24.630
knocking out her front teeth.

96
06:24.870 --> 06:26.190
She can barely speak clearly now.

97
06:26.360 --> 06:29.120
Why wouldn't you listen to Lanxiang?

98
06:29.640 --> 06:31.720
How will you face anyone in public after this?

99
06:32.120 --> 06:33.600
Then I don't want to go out anyway.

100
06:42.680 --> 06:43.950
Go on.

101
06:54.680 --> 06:55.950
Lanxiang,

102
06:57.560 --> 06:58.720
you must be tired, too.

103
06:59.680 --> 07:01.480
Go back and get some rest.

104
07:03.270 --> 07:03.950
Yes.

105
07:06.040 --> 07:06.630
By the way,

106
07:12.600 --> 07:13.560
I heard

107
07:13.950 --> 07:15.870
your mother hasn't been well.

108
07:16.480 --> 07:17.560
Then let her

109
07:17.560 --> 07:19.950
stay at Zhichun Hall a while longer.

110
07:20.120 --> 07:22.360
That way, you can tend to her at her bedside.

111
07:31.270 --> 07:32.480
Thank you, Old Master.

112
07:33.600 --> 07:34.390
Go on.

113
07:40.510 --> 07:41.560
This lamp

114
07:42.040 --> 07:44.360
is the fire in a woman's heart.

115
07:45.750 --> 07:47.950
It has burned amid the cooking smoke of countless homes

116
07:49.270 --> 07:51.430
and lit the way for countless women washing clothes.

117
07:52.680 --> 07:54.510
One lamp lights ten,

118
07:54.920 --> 07:56.830
ten lamps light a hundred,

119
07:57.120 --> 07:59.270
a hundred lamps light a thousand,

120
08:00.120 --> 08:02.430
until ten thousand lamps shine bright,

121
08:03.120 --> 08:05.510
turning the long night into day.

122
08:07.260 --> 08:09.900
(The Tale of the Burning Lamps)

123
08:12.510 --> 08:13.270
Wonderful.

124
08:15.240 --> 08:16.120
Truly wonderful.

125
08:17.430 --> 08:18.800
It's beautifully written.

126
08:19.520 --> 08:20.776
I also think Mister Shen Rugu's

127
08:20.824 --> 08:22.940
The Tale of the Burning Lamps is beautifully written.

128
08:22.950 --> 08:24.600
But as Mother listened,

129
08:24.950 --> 08:26.160
she remained silent

130
08:26.270 --> 08:27.870
and never once praised it.

131
08:32.200 --> 08:33.870
When you grow up,

132
08:35.120 --> 08:36.360
you'll understand.

133
08:49.720 --> 08:50.840
You are back.

134
08:50.960 --> 08:52.510
Grandma has been waiting for you.

135
08:56.510 --> 08:57.600
Zhangcheng,

136
09:01.270 --> 09:02.600
go see Grandpa.

137
09:03.670 --> 09:05.150
See what he's doing.

138
09:06.150 --> 09:09.030
Let me talk with your mother.

139
09:09.750 --> 09:10.320
All right.

140
09:29.360 --> 09:31.670
Old Master wants you and Father

141
09:31.670 --> 09:33.390
to stay at the residence a while longer.

142
09:34.200 --> 09:35.910
Later, I'll cook

143
09:36.440 --> 09:38.000
your favorite dishes for you.

144
09:42.080 --> 09:43.240
There are

145
09:44.670 --> 09:46.270
plenty of women

146
09:47.000 --> 09:48.200
in this world who can cook.

147
09:48.720 --> 09:50.200
They don't need you for that.

148
09:55.550 --> 09:57.270
These hands of yours

149
09:59.120 --> 10:02.360
must keep writing.

150
10:03.320 --> 10:05.270
Write down what we want to say

151
10:08.030 --> 10:09.240
but don't know how to say,

152
10:10.200 --> 10:11.910
and what we simply can't

153
10:13.480 --> 10:14.870
put into words.

154
10:19.150 --> 10:19.960
All right.

155
10:25.960 --> 10:28.080
Cry. Cry as hard as you can.

156
10:29.320 --> 10:30.390
Let it all out.

157
10:30.664 --> 10:32.510
When you're done, we'll live our lives well.

158
10:34.670 --> 10:35.750
Live with all your might,

159
10:37.270 --> 10:38.270
like wild grass,

160
10:40.120 --> 10:41.670
without caring what anyone thinks.

161
10:44.200 --> 10:45.360
I hoped

162
10:46.790 --> 10:49.390
you'd live like wild grass.

163
10:50.550 --> 10:52.270
Not only did you do that,

164
10:54.000 --> 10:55.840
but you've also done

165
10:56.200 --> 10:57.080
far more

166
10:57.720 --> 10:58.550
and far better

167
10:59.630 --> 11:00.480
than I ever imagined.

168
11:04.270 --> 11:05.960
You're like wild grass,

169
11:11.440 --> 11:12.750
but also like a flower,

170
11:16.080 --> 11:16.750
like

171
11:17.600 --> 11:18.600
a great tree.

172
11:23.080 --> 11:24.240
Not only

173
11:25.256 --> 11:27.096
have you made a good life for yourself,

174
11:29.910 --> 11:32.080
but you've helped others live well too,

175
11:32.790 --> 11:35.240
and helped them make a place for themselves in this world.

176
11:37.630 --> 11:38.630
I'm happy.

177
11:41.790 --> 11:42.630
So happy.

178
11:48.600 --> 11:50.200
Mother, are you feeling unwell?

179
11:51.720 --> 11:53.000
I'll get the physician.

180
11:57.390 --> 11:58.440
I'm fine.

181
12:00.510 --> 12:01.750
I'm doing very well.

182
12:22.910 --> 12:23.790
Lanxiang

183
12:26.080 --> 12:27.440
has come to take me.

184
12:49.150 --> 12:50.080
Don't cry.

185
12:52.750 --> 12:53.670
It's a good thing.

186
12:54.360 --> 12:55.270
A good thing.

187
12:59.960 --> 13:00.870
A good thing.

188
13:03.120 --> 13:04.030
A good thing.

189
13:09.790 --> 13:10.600
I

190
13:14.480 --> 13:16.080
can finally be reunited

191
13:16.600 --> 13:17.960
with Lanxiang.

192
13:22.510 --> 13:24.080
It's been twenty-four years.

193
13:27.270 --> 13:29.510
I never had the chance to spend enough time with her.

194
13:35.360 --> 13:38.720
Now that you're all grown up,

195
13:42.720 --> 13:44.000
I can leave

196
13:44.600 --> 13:45.390
without worrying.

197
13:47.200 --> 13:47.870
Mother...

198
13:52.270 --> 13:53.080
I'm going now.

199
14:00.870 --> 14:02.080
Don't worry, Mother.

200
14:05.270 --> 14:06.840
I'll take good care of myself.

201
14:13.670 --> 14:14.550
Mother...

202
14:24.750 --> 14:26.080
In this life,

203
14:28.910 --> 14:30.790
having a daughter like you

204
14:34.670 --> 14:35.670
has been such a blessing.

205
14:40.480 --> 14:41.790
Such a blessing.

206
14:44.670 --> 14:45.480
Mother.

207
14:51.410 --> 14:54.340
♪The wind blows past distant hills♪

208
14:55.640 --> 14:58.630
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

209
14:59.660 --> 15:03.330
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

210
15:03.850 --> 15:06.640
♪Peace of heart in three places♪

211
15:07.570 --> 15:10.830
♪The years are calluses in our palms♪

212
15:11.950 --> 15:14.950
♪And the worries etched between our brows♪

213
15:16.230 --> 15:20.210
♪Birds carry twigs into the distance♪

214
15:20.500 --> 15:23.130
♪While two pairs of eyes watch from below♪

215
15:23.220 --> 15:23.910
Lanxiang.

216
15:26.170 --> 15:29.860
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

217
15:30.370 --> 15:34.130
♪Snow falls white upon the eaves♪

218
15:34.560 --> 15:38.940
♪Four seasons wax and wane, year after year♪

219
15:39.080 --> 15:42.210
♪Whose footsteps come and go?♪

220
15:42.940 --> 15:46.530
♪You're a river flowing to shore♪

221
15:47.020 --> 15:50.330
♪You're a cloud passing over the mountains♪

222
15:51.170 --> 15:55.400
♪The journey home always carries joy and sorrow♪

223
15:55.720 --> 16:00.090
♪People gather, then part♪

224
16:01.350 --> 16:04.100
♪Regret is a letter wishing you well♪

225
16:04.120 --> 16:04.750
Lanxiang.

226
16:05.030 --> 16:05.720
Don't cry.

227
16:07.360 --> 16:08.240
Your mother

228
16:08.510 --> 16:09.670
was blessed.

229
16:10.150 --> 16:14.060
♪Back home, leaves fall upon the blue-tiled roofs♪

230
16:14.260 --> 16:18.010
♪Leaving only a little house behind♪

231
16:32.670 --> 16:34.390
As long as there's something to hope for,

232
16:34.480 --> 16:35.720
no matter how hard life gets,

233
16:35.910 --> 16:37.030
you can make it through.

234
16:37.480 --> 16:38.270
I ate the drumstick

235
16:38.270 --> 16:39.150
so I could run faster

236
16:39.150 --> 16:40.750
and catch up with you two.

237
16:41.600 --> 16:43.360
Whatever happens, don't be afraid.

238
16:43.510 --> 16:44.630
Come home to your parents.

239
16:44.840 --> 16:45.910
Today, you've come home.

240
16:45.992 --> 16:47.600
That makes it a good day for our family.

241
16:47.790 --> 16:48.550
Isn't it beautiful?

242
16:49.630 --> 16:50.320
Take it.

243
16:51.510 --> 16:54.360
Later, I'll tidy the place up and make it into a proper home.

244
16:54.424 --> 16:56.080
It'll be a good place for the three of us.

245
16:57.150 --> 16:57.960
It's beautiful.

246
16:58.440 --> 16:59.240
I like it.

247
17:00.720 --> 17:01.550
It's flying!

248
17:02.790 --> 17:04.240
It's flying so high!

249
17:22.260 --> 17:26.060
(Back Courtyard of a Medical Hall in Jinling)

250
17:59.000 --> 18:01.310
Good horse. Nice horse.

251
18:01.512 --> 18:02.920
I'll only ride you for a moment.

252
18:27.350 --> 18:27.880
Young Lady.

253
18:31.750 --> 18:32.350
Be careful.

254
18:36.696 --> 18:37.440
Are you all right?

255
18:39.400 --> 18:40.240
Sir!

256
18:42.968 --> 18:44.690
You didn't hurt yourself just now, did you?

257
18:46.590 --> 18:47.510
I'm fine.

258
18:47.510 --> 18:48.550
I didn't get hurt at all.

259
18:49.310 --> 18:50.830
Are you here to see the physician?

260
18:51.128 --> 18:52.808
I'm accompanying my sister-in-law.

261
18:53.270 --> 18:54.590
She said I talk too much

262
18:54.590 --> 18:55.790
and sent me outside.

263
18:56.590 --> 18:58.000
What brings you to the medical hall?

264
18:58.120 --> 18:59.440
Are you here for treatment, too?

265
19:00.000 --> 19:01.240
It's my horse that's unwell.

266
19:01.750 --> 19:03.270
I'm leaving it here for a few days

267
19:03.270 --> 19:04.350
to recover.

268
19:06.480 --> 19:07.750
So it's your horse.

269
19:08.510 --> 19:09.880
No wonder I took to it right away.

270
19:10.568 --> 19:11.960
Do you like riding horses too?

271
19:12.008 --> 19:14.260
I secretly rode one a couple of times when I was little.

272
19:14.270 --> 19:16.424
My eldest brother even said I had a natural talent for it.

273
19:16.920 --> 19:17.680
But

274
19:18.070 --> 19:19.110
Mother said

275
19:19.304 --> 19:21.480
riding wasn't something a young lady should learn,

276
19:21.656 --> 19:22.750
so she wouldn't let me.

277
19:23.960 --> 19:25.000
Riding isn't difficult.

278
19:25.550 --> 19:26.830
When you get the chance,

279
19:26.920 --> 19:28.640
practice more and you'll learn.

280
19:33.160 --> 19:34.590
First I need the chance.

281
19:37.310 --> 19:37.960
Someday,

282
19:38.640 --> 19:40.160
I'll learn to ride.

283
19:41.110 --> 19:42.270
I'll travel far and wide

284
19:42.960 --> 19:44.640
and see all the wonders of the land.

285
19:49.110 --> 19:50.070
In this world,

286
19:52.270 --> 19:54.350
most men seek rank and fortune.

287
19:55.310 --> 19:56.070
As for women,

288
19:56.480 --> 19:57.920
most hope for an accomplished husband

289
19:58.720 --> 19:59.880
and dutiful children.

290
20:02.070 --> 20:03.350
An ambition like yours

291
20:03.920 --> 20:04.720
is rather unusual.

292
20:07.310 --> 20:09.030
You seem to be a scholar, too.

293
20:09.208 --> 20:11.000
Don't you wish to enter official service?

294
20:13.920 --> 20:15.270
I'm rather awkward by nature

295
20:16.480 --> 20:17.680
and not suited to officialdom.

296
20:19.920 --> 20:20.750
In this life,

297
20:21.960 --> 20:23.440
I only wish to travel far and wide

298
20:23.750 --> 20:25.200
and see all the wonders of the land.

299
20:28.720 --> 20:30.590
It seems we share the same ambition.

300
20:33.310 --> 20:34.480
How wonderful.

301
20:35.880 --> 20:37.240
As long as a man has the courage,

302
20:37.680 --> 20:39.590
he can live life on his own terms.

303
20:48.200 --> 20:49.640
Where will you go next?

304
20:50.600 --> 20:51.896
After the Chinese New Year,

305
20:52.008 --> 20:54.160
I'm thinking of traveling to Yunnan and Guizhou.

306
21:04.550 --> 21:05.200
Sir,

307
21:05.496 --> 21:07.464
meeting again means fate has brought us together.

308
21:07.920 --> 21:08.440
This time,

309
21:08.750 --> 21:10.880
please tell me your name

310
21:10.880 --> 21:12.000
and where you live.

311
21:12.184 --> 21:14.200
Tomorrow, I'll have my Fourth Brother visit you

312
21:14.310 --> 21:15.590
to thank you for saving my life.

313
21:16.070 --> 21:17.480
Our two families can become close,

314
21:17.550 --> 21:19.256
and from then on, we'll be like one family.

315
21:20.310 --> 21:21.030
Later,

316
21:21.480 --> 21:22.680
when you go to Guizhou

317
21:22.960 --> 21:23.680
and Yunnan,

318
21:24.310 --> 21:26.510
if you come across anything beautiful or interesting,

319
21:26.616 --> 21:28.400
you can write to my Fourth Brother about it.

320
21:28.440 --> 21:30.648
I'll help my Fourth Brother write back to you.

321
21:32.680 --> 21:34.984
It's rare to meet someone who shares the same aspirations.

322
21:35.310 --> 21:36.350
Enjoying something alone

323
21:36.552 --> 21:38.392
isn't as good as sharing it with others.

324
21:46.110 --> 21:47.350
You're right.

325
21:48.270 --> 21:49.310
Enjoying something alone

326
21:49.752 --> 21:51.512
isn't as good as sharing it with others.

327
21:57.310 --> 21:59.030
May I ask

328
21:59.510 --> 22:01.590
where you live and your place among your siblings?

329
22:01.920 --> 22:03.200
Give me a few days to prepare.

330
22:03.200 --> 22:05.590
In ten days, I will be sure to visit.

331
22:06.160 --> 22:07.070
My surname is Lin.

332
22:07.336 --> 22:09.310
I'm the second among the sisters in my family.

333
22:09.550 --> 22:10.790
I live on Yanling Lane.

334
22:12.920 --> 22:13.750
Yanling Lane?

335
22:14.720 --> 22:15.550
The Lin Residence?

336
22:16.200 --> 22:17.640
Then Marquis Jing'an is...

337
22:20.200 --> 22:21.310
He's my eldest brother.

338
22:22.640 --> 22:24.160
My brother is a good man.

339
22:24.170 --> 22:25.830
He chooses his friends for their character

340
22:25.848 --> 22:27.720
and doesn't care about family background.

341
22:30.750 --> 22:31.550
Sir,

342
22:32.680 --> 22:35.000
you promised you'd come visit.

343
22:36.070 --> 22:37.160
A gentleman keeps his word.

344
22:38.160 --> 22:39.200
In ten days,

345
22:39.790 --> 22:41.830
I will be sure to pay my respects to Old Master Lin.

346
22:43.400 --> 22:44.350
It's a promise.

347
23:09.110 --> 23:10.030
I've come today

348
23:10.184 --> 23:12.456
to ask for the hand of your family's Second Young Lady.

349
23:12.792 --> 23:14.350
This may seem like a hasty decision,

350
23:15.000 --> 23:16.550
but I have given it careful thought.

351
23:16.872 --> 23:18.160
Every word comes from my heart.

352
23:18.170 --> 23:19.990
I would never treat this as a trifling matter.

353
23:21.000 --> 23:22.110
Old Master Lin,

354
23:22.790 --> 23:24.590
I ask that you consider my proposal

355
23:26.152 --> 23:27.672
in light of my sincerity.

356
23:41.680 --> 23:42.640
Very well.

357
23:45.310 --> 23:46.590
Our two families

358
23:48.110 --> 23:49.680
have known each other for generations.

359
23:50.248 --> 23:51.590
There's no need to be so formal.

360
23:52.480 --> 23:53.590
Sit down and we'll talk.

361
23:55.432 --> 23:57.608
Thank you for offering me a seat, Old Master Lin.

362
24:11.030 --> 24:11.590
Hurry up.

363
24:13.496 --> 24:14.960
You're always saying you're old,

364
24:15.030 --> 24:17.096
but you're getting quicker on your feet by the day.

365
24:18.160 --> 24:19.270
The suitor who came today

366
24:19.270 --> 24:20.860
is from a respectable scholarly family.

367
24:20.960 --> 24:23.784
His family is well-off, and he even a Presented Scholar.

368
24:23.880 --> 24:24.720
I'm telling you,

369
24:24.790 --> 24:26.070
you'd better behave yourself.

370
24:26.104 --> 24:27.784
You won't find another chance like this.

371
24:27.960 --> 24:28.830
A Presented Scholar?

372
24:28.900 --> 24:30.760
Matchmakers will say anything to make a match.

373
24:30.800 --> 24:33.000
At best, he's probably only a provincial graduate.

374
24:33.010 --> 24:34.590
What's wrong with a provincial graduate?

375
24:34.640 --> 24:35.960
There are so many scholars in the world.

376
24:36.070 --> 24:37.624
How many of them ever pass the provincial examination?

377
24:37.640 --> 24:39.550
Mother, be reasonable.

378
24:42.400 --> 24:43.590
I'm already thirty-five.

379
24:44.000 --> 24:45.350
A respectable scholarly family,

380
24:45.510 --> 24:47.590
well-off, and he's passed the provincial examination.

381
24:47.784 --> 24:49.960
What decent man with all that would still be unmarried?

382
24:50.632 --> 24:52.984
There must be something seriously wrong with him.

383
24:53.160 --> 24:55.030
Mother, please don't push your own daughter

384
24:55.030 --> 24:56.070
into a pit of fire.

385
24:58.030 --> 24:58.960
Mother!

386
24:58.960 --> 24:59.640
Aren't you

387
24:59.640 --> 25:01.000
still unmarried yourself?

388
25:01.128 --> 25:03.176
There's nothing seriously wrong with you.

389
25:05.270 --> 25:06.830
Xiuwan.

390
25:08.550 --> 25:09.750
He was married before.

391
25:10.790 --> 25:12.510
His wife died many years ago.

392
25:13.000 --> 25:14.720
He didn't want to remarry before

393
25:15.510 --> 25:16.830
and spent years traveling.

394
25:16.920 --> 25:18.920
He only returned to Jinling this year.

395
25:19.440 --> 25:20.510
For some reason,

396
25:20.510 --> 25:22.440
he suddenly decided he wanted to marry again.

397
25:23.032 --> 25:24.510
Don't think too much about it yet.

398
25:24.640 --> 25:26.510
Come take a look with me first. Let's go.

399
25:28.240 --> 25:30.720
My savior is coming to visit today.

400
25:30.880 --> 25:33.160
I know. We've prepared all the thank-you gifts for you.

401
25:33.270 --> 25:34.640
Jincen has been waiting for him.

402
25:37.110 --> 25:39.200
And my suitor is coming today too...

403
25:39.200 --> 25:40.000
Exactly.

404
25:40.110 --> 25:41.200
That's why I'm taking you

405
25:41.200 --> 25:42.310
to sneak a look at him.

406
25:42.376 --> 25:44.350
You can decide for yourself whether you like him.

407
25:44.456 --> 25:46.888
Then you can't keep saying I'm pushing you into a pit of fire.

408
25:50.510 --> 25:51.750
You've finally come around?

409
25:52.000 --> 25:52.830
Finally?

410
25:54.240 --> 25:55.350
That's rare.

411
25:55.350 --> 25:56.830
Very rare indeed.

412
26:24.200 --> 26:25.160
Come on. Let's go.

413
26:28.000 --> 26:30.230
Even if I have to support you for the rest of your life,

414
26:30.240 --> 26:32.392
I will never let you marry a snobbish man like that.

415
26:33.070 --> 26:33.960
Then I won't marry him.

416
26:34.270 --> 26:35.110
But Mother, you can't

417
26:35.110 --> 26:36.424
speak that way about my savior.

418
26:36.920 --> 26:38.160
He's a man of noble character,

419
26:38.200 --> 26:39.160
upright and honorable.

420
26:39.256 --> 26:41.624
He's certainly not a snob who only cares about status.

421
26:42.070 --> 26:42.880
You think he isn't

422
26:42.880 --> 26:44.310
a snob who only cares about status?

423
26:44.408 --> 26:46.328
Then why did he marry Sixth Young Lady Zhao?

424
26:46.424 --> 26:48.520
Wasn't it because the Zhao family was powerful?

425
26:49.830 --> 26:50.310
Let's go.

426
26:52.350 --> 26:53.270
Sixth Young Lady Zhao?

427
26:54.960 --> 26:55.790
Sir?

428
26:57.590 --> 26:58.590
He is...

429
26:59.032 --> 27:02.488
My surname is Xie, my given name is Zhao, and my courtesy name is Xianzhang.

430
27:04.510 --> 27:05.750
Xie Zhao!

431
27:05.848 --> 27:08.328
How dare you send a matchmaker here to propose marriage!

432
27:09.000 --> 27:10.070
Today, I swear I'll...

433
27:10.070 --> 27:10.720
I'll...

434
27:10.720 --> 27:11.920
Lingxiao,

435
27:13.640 --> 27:15.510
let the two of them speak for themselves.

436
27:21.350 --> 27:22.270
Old Master Lin,

437
27:23.750 --> 27:25.550
surely this isn't proper.

438
27:25.790 --> 27:27.440
What's improper about it?

439
27:28.200 --> 27:30.310
Her grandfather and mother are both here.

440
27:30.830 --> 27:33.070
The two of them happened to meet,

441
27:33.310 --> 27:35.240
so they can greet each other.

442
27:36.790 --> 27:37.720
Come here.

443
28:00.280 --> 28:01.640
I sincerely wish to marry you.

444
28:06.344 --> 28:09.432
Enjoying something alone isn't as good as sharing it with someone.

445
28:10.200 --> 28:11.510
Traveling the world alone

446
28:12.248 --> 28:13.960
isn't as good as traveling together.

447
28:18.070 --> 28:19.920
Now that you know who I am,

448
28:19.960 --> 28:22.264
how can you still dare to come here and propose?

449
28:24.616 --> 28:26.680
Back then, I was young and had no mind of my own.

450
28:27.224 --> 28:29.080
I let my parents' obsession with family status

451
28:29.100 --> 28:30.890
lead me into a marriage with the Zhao family.

452
28:30.960 --> 28:32.160
Now I understand

453
28:32.790 --> 28:33.510
what I want

454
28:34.200 --> 28:34.960
and what I seek.

455
28:36.424 --> 28:38.088
I won't make the same mistake again

456
28:38.264 --> 28:39.750
and let family status hold me back

457
28:39.928 --> 28:41.200
from missing a true match.

458
28:47.070 --> 28:48.270
What happened back then

459
28:49.240 --> 28:50.680
wasn't entirely your fault.

460
28:52.070 --> 28:53.070
I was at fault, too.

461
28:54.640 --> 28:57.070
I fell for a man of poor character

462
28:57.560 --> 28:59.720
and nearly ran away with him without a matchmaker.

463
29:02.440 --> 29:02.960
You...

464
29:03.400 --> 29:05.160
This must never be spoken of, even on pain of death!

465
29:05.200 --> 29:06.750
You foolish girl.

466
29:17.070 --> 29:18.590
Back then, I wasn't worthy of you yet.

467
29:20.310 --> 29:21.790
That's why Heaven made each of us

468
29:22.440 --> 29:23.550
take a longer road

469
29:24.830 --> 29:26.030
and become better people

470
29:26.830 --> 29:28.000
before we truly met.

471
29:34.350 --> 29:35.750
Now I'm worthy of you, too.

472
29:39.030 --> 29:40.440
Would you be willing to join me

473
29:41.960 --> 29:43.000
in traveling far and wide

474
29:43.400 --> 29:45.310
and seeing all the wonders of the land?

475
29:45.570 --> 29:48.660
♪Plum blossoms bloom, enduring the frost♪

476
29:49.030 --> 29:54.390
♪Yet their proud spirit fades with wind and snow♪

477
29:54.640 --> 29:57.530
♪Bamboo shadows embrace quiet contentment♪

478
29:57.750 --> 30:00.740
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

479
30:01.130 --> 30:06.480
♪Watching the old and new take turns in this world♪

480
30:06.680 --> 30:12.170
♪Spring comes, and I smile upon a garden in full bloom♪

481
30:12.770 --> 30:18.460
♪Autumn passes, and I let the blossoms fade away♪

482
30:18.910 --> 30:22.600
♪A scroll of time slowly unfolds♪

483
30:22.790 --> 30:31.500
♪I read every joy and sorrow behind the curtain♪

484
30:38.920 --> 30:41.640
Why do I suddenly feel like crying?

485
30:43.200 --> 30:43.960
Then cry.

486
30:44.110 --> 30:44.640
I...

487
30:46.550 --> 30:47.070
I...

488
31:04.420 --> 31:09.060
(Amid the Sea of Suffering)

489
31:17.030 --> 31:17.720
Lanxiang,

490
31:17.790 --> 31:18.680
have some soup.

491
31:43.310 --> 31:44.480
These days,

492
31:44.790 --> 31:47.240
you've been copying scriptures and praying for Aunt Guihua,

493
31:47.510 --> 31:48.680
so you can't eat meat.

494
31:48.984 --> 31:51.304
It's the perfect chance for me to show off my cooking.

495
31:53.110 --> 31:55.680
Your cooking is certainly worth showing off.

496
31:57.750 --> 31:58.510
Back then,

497
31:58.830 --> 32:00.510
Old Madam Yuan had a weak stomach

498
32:00.920 --> 32:02.000
and didn't like meat,

499
32:02.720 --> 32:04.240
but she still needed nourishing food.

500
32:04.824 --> 32:05.880
So I went out of my way

501
32:05.880 --> 32:08.376
to learn how to cook vegetarian dishes from the temple monks.

502
32:08.552 --> 32:10.488
I thought all that effort had gone to waste,

503
32:10.920 --> 32:13.400
but it turns out I learned it so I could take care of you.

504
32:14.920 --> 32:16.480
It seems that in this life,

505
32:16.792 --> 32:18.440
whether the road is bitter or sweet,

506
32:19.000 --> 32:20.640
not a single step is wasted.

507
32:29.440 --> 32:30.350
These days,

508
32:30.696 --> 32:32.488
I couldn't have managed without all of you.

509
32:34.680 --> 32:36.070
Jincen and his wife

510
32:36.440 --> 32:37.960
have helped arrange the funeral

511
32:38.480 --> 32:39.720
with such care and attention.

512
32:40.590 --> 32:43.720
Xiulai has handled the household affairs

513
32:44.070 --> 32:45.830
without giving me a thing to worry about.

514
32:47.160 --> 32:49.400
Xiuwan has helped look after the children

515
32:49.790 --> 32:51.880
and has them all behaving perfectly.

516
32:54.510 --> 32:55.680
Xiushu heard

517
32:55.832 --> 32:58.070
that my father wanted to stay at a temple for a while,

518
32:58.248 --> 33:00.000
so she asked her husband to accompany him

519
33:00.590 --> 33:03.480
into the mountains to find an elderly monk well-versed in the scriptures.

520
33:06.240 --> 33:07.160
And then there's you,

521
33:09.000 --> 33:11.160
making something different for every meal

522
33:11.608 --> 33:13.688
because you're afraid I won't have an appetite.

523
33:14.550 --> 33:16.270
Lanxiang, you'd better rack your brains

524
33:16.376 --> 33:17.890
and find some new ways to praise me.

525
33:17.920 --> 33:19.310
I love hearing compliments.

526
33:20.968 --> 33:22.648
Then I won't waste words on compliments.

527
33:27.070 --> 33:28.510
Madam, Third Young Lady.

528
33:29.440 --> 33:30.720
Tongcao just sent word.

529
33:30.830 --> 33:33.310
The Yuan family's Third Granduncle has come with his two sons,

530
33:33.960 --> 33:35.440
demanding to see Third Young Lady.

531
33:37.704 --> 33:39.176
Let them wait a little longer.

532
33:39.920 --> 33:41.310
We've already got them stewing.

533
33:41.720 --> 33:44.110
We should let them stew until they lose their patience.

534
33:46.790 --> 33:47.590
Yes.

535
33:55.640 --> 33:57.030
Lanxiang, aren't you going to ask

536
33:57.224 --> 33:58.640
what kind of show I'm putting on?

537
34:03.070 --> 34:05.590
What kind of show are you putting on?

538
34:10.072 --> 34:12.480
Even with the written agreement His Lordship left behind

539
34:12.744 --> 34:14.310
stating that the Yuan family's property

540
34:14.320 --> 34:16.632
can only be inherited by his daughters born of his wife,

541
34:17.000 --> 34:19.400
the Yuan clansmen won't let the matter rest.

542
34:19.550 --> 34:22.296
They keep harping on the fact that the Marquis's household has no son

543
34:22.670 --> 34:24.630
and plan to have a son adopted into the family,

544
34:24.640 --> 34:27.190
so they can claim the title first and then swallow up the estate.

545
34:28.360 --> 34:29.630
Since they're so greedy,

546
34:30.280 --> 34:31.190
they can't blame me

547
34:31.400 --> 34:32.670
for cutting them off at the root

548
34:32.856 --> 34:34.520
and ending the threat once and for all.

549
34:39.840 --> 34:40.510
No wonder

550
34:40.710 --> 34:42.230
the rumors outside

551
34:42.760 --> 34:44.400
sound so convincing.

552
34:44.472 --> 34:46.840
They say Marquis Yongchang delayed military operations,

553
34:47.030 --> 34:48.670
causing soldiers to die needlessly.

554
34:48.960 --> 34:51.320
His Majesty will not only strip him of his title,

555
34:51.510 --> 34:52.710
but also punish him severely.

556
34:54.000 --> 34:55.230
Third Young Lady Lin

557
34:55.256 --> 34:57.920
was so frightened that she fled back to her family with her children

558
34:58.000 --> 35:00.024
and intends to sever all ties with the Yuan family.

559
35:03.144 --> 35:03.920
And here I thought

560
35:03.920 --> 35:05.550
you came especially to keep me company.

561
35:07.190 --> 35:08.230
Both reasons.

562
35:08.296 --> 35:10.320
I did come especially to keep you company too.

563
35:13.230 --> 35:14.710
Madam, Third Young Lady.

564
35:15.320 --> 35:18.216
Third Young Master found out the Yuan family came to cause trouble.

565
35:18.248 --> 35:20.320
He went out on crutches with the two young masters

566
35:20.320 --> 35:21.490
to drive the Yuan family away.

567
35:21.670 --> 35:23.000
They exchanged only a few words

568
35:23.240 --> 35:24.880
before he started fighting with them.

569
35:27.560 --> 35:28.632
Third Young Master said

570
35:28.696 --> 35:30.500
you had already planned to separate back then,

571
35:30.536 --> 35:31.976
so it's not too late to do it now.

572
35:32.480 --> 35:34.440
After all, the Yuan family has always resented

573
35:34.440 --> 35:36.000
Third Young Lady for not bearing a son.

574
35:37.590 --> 35:38.670
This fire we've stirred up

575
35:38.920 --> 35:41.128
actually ended up setting Jinqiao off first.

576
35:41.960 --> 35:43.630
Lanxiang, take your time eating.

577
35:43.960 --> 35:45.070
I'll be right back.

578
35:45.800 --> 35:46.480
All right.

579
36:03.800 --> 36:05.760
No wonder she was

580
36:06.216 --> 36:08.880
the first to sense something was wrong with Du Cuique back then.

581
36:19.510 --> 36:20.880
Seeing Third Young Lady

582
36:21.144 --> 36:22.670
reminds me of how I used to be.

583
36:26.520 --> 36:28.440
I used to think deeply about everything too.

584
36:31.736 --> 36:33.320
Given the circumstances back then,

585
36:33.656 --> 36:35.070
you had to think several steps ahead

586
36:35.510 --> 36:37.110
just to survive.

587
36:41.160 --> 36:42.904
My father died when I was young.

588
36:43.760 --> 36:44.800
After my mother remarried,

589
36:44.800 --> 36:46.280
she had several more children,

590
36:47.070 --> 36:48.000
both sons and daughters.

591
36:49.416 --> 36:51.510
Ever since I was little, I was the one no one needed.

592
36:52.776 --> 36:54.320
I only ever looked out for myself.

593
36:55.760 --> 36:56.630
I never thought

594
36:56.630 --> 36:58.960
that children owed their parents anything,

595
37:00.150 --> 37:01.070
nor did I think

596
37:01.230 --> 37:03.590
that a servant had to be loyal to her master.

597
37:10.960 --> 37:12.190
Then I met you,

598
37:12.840 --> 37:14.960
learned to read, and began studying.

599
37:15.544 --> 37:17.512
The road ahead grew wider and brighter,

600
37:17.816 --> 37:19.320
and only then did I begin to change.

601
37:24.320 --> 37:25.670
Sometimes I don't even dare imagine

602
37:28.190 --> 37:29.510
what I'd be like now

603
37:31.110 --> 37:32.440
if I'd never met you.

604
37:47.110 --> 37:48.150
I can't take the credit.

605
37:49.080 --> 37:51.144
The Buddha saves those with whom he has affinity.

606
37:51.150 --> 37:53.390
You found your way because you had the wisdom within you.

607
37:55.400 --> 37:56.630
Lanxiang!

608
38:10.670 --> 38:12.150
You settled it so quickly?

609
38:13.280 --> 38:14.670
The Yuan family's Third Granduncle

610
38:14.840 --> 38:16.590
accidentally took a fall,

611
38:17.230 --> 38:19.190
then made a scene and blamed us for it.

612
38:19.272 --> 38:21.480
He insisted on severing all clan and family ties with us

613
38:21.590 --> 38:23.000
and even had the papers drawn up.

614
38:24.630 --> 38:25.360
Now,

615
38:25.710 --> 38:27.590
I'm a widow with no one to rely on,

616
38:28.000 --> 38:29.510
Jinqi isn't in Jinling,

617
38:29.630 --> 38:31.110
and you're still in mourning.

618
38:31.360 --> 38:32.440
With no other choice,

619
38:32.710 --> 38:35.230
I could only sign and seal the document in tears.

620
38:37.920 --> 38:39.480
You were right.

621
38:42.050 --> 38:43.190
The Yuan family was terrified

622
38:43.200 --> 38:45.500
of being implicated and punished because of His Lordship.

623
38:45.510 --> 38:47.080
They were even more anxious than I was,

624
38:47.144 --> 38:50.030
dragging Jincen to the authorities to register us as a separate household.

625
38:50.040 --> 38:51.190
It'll all be settled today.

626
38:53.400 --> 38:54.110
From now on,

627
38:54.520 --> 38:56.200
though we still share the surname Yuan,

628
38:56.550 --> 38:57.800
we'll be two separate families.

629
38:58.344 --> 39:01.380
Whatever fortune or misfortune befalls us will have nothing to do with them.

630
39:16.400 --> 39:18.110
The Wona forces have withdrawn!

631
39:18.360 --> 39:18.800
What?

632
39:18.960 --> 39:19.630
Really?

633
39:20.190 --> 39:21.960
The Wona army has retreated!

634
39:22.000 --> 39:23.920
The Wona forces have withdrawn!

635
39:24.480 --> 39:27.030
The Wona army has retreated!

636
40:06.840 --> 40:07.800
Your Majesty,

637
40:08.840 --> 40:09.800
our forces

638
40:09.896 --> 40:11.400
attacked from both within and without.

639
40:11.920 --> 40:13.920
The Wona army was utterly routed

640
40:14.550 --> 40:15.190
and has

641
40:15.590 --> 40:17.150
retreated from the capital in haste.

642
40:17.256 --> 40:20.920
- Congratulations, Your Majesty! - Congratulations, Your Majesty!

643
40:21.208 --> 40:23.260
(Upholding Heaven's Mandate) In this great victory,

644
40:23.280 --> 40:25.096
Minister Han coordinated everything properly

